Subject: Next week: writing tests and handling errors in your R functions. And, more paper discussions coming!
Message-ID: <V-ighg4Ct7Q.hNawFCuxAwAJ@davis-rug.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/davis-rug/c/V-ighg4Ct7Q/m/hNawFCuxAwAJ>
